{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42442825"}, "name":{"label":"trkevig"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-06-04T04:29:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"11342014554"}, "title":{"label":"Perfect except…"}, "content":{"label":"Perfect for Apple Watch and iPhone. Would be even better if had support for Garmin devices that are connected to Apple health. Any chance you could look at making this possible plz?\n\nAlso, it seems Pedometer is always about 2,000 steps behind Apple iPhone since the last update…. Any ideas?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id17559935"}, "name":{"label":"Apple Customer 11"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-05-28T22:33:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"11318858961"}, "title":{"label":"Apple Watch Battery Issues & Numbers"}, "content":{"label":"My problem was the battery life on my Apple Watch was seriously affected by the app. But after uninstalling the app and reinstalling it the issue was rectified. Another problem I have is the step/stairs figures on my iPhone do not match my Apple Watch so not good for counting steps as I don’t know which one is correct.  Also the developer just does not reply to my queries.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id11789293"}, "name":{"label":"andrevenancio.com"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-05-21T13:35:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"11292336340"}, "title":{"label":"Data issues"}, "content":{"label":"I was well above 30 day streak (I have screenshots to prove it). The streak started in London and then carry out to NY where I stay a couple of weeks. Today I got back to London and my 30+ days streak is now a 3 day streak here, 4 day streak there and the same happen on my wife’s phone. We were doing our best to go beyond 10k steps every day and it was just a great excuse to go out and exercise. Now. Im very dissatisfied with this whole situation. How can this happen? Why was my daily streak going on for days and today all of the sudden doesn’t work? I always had internet connection. So this is either bad calculations with timestamps at different time zones, or a database regression that had bad data. Can this be fixed?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
